# Gold Gemini IPA is locked

`data/gold_gemini_ipa/` is the only pronunciation dataset. It is user-validated. Do not regenerate it.

- Do not resynthesize `wavs/`.
- Do not edit `ipa.json`, `manifest.jsonl`, or `summary.json`.
- Do not chmod those files. They are read-only on purpose.
- Do not rebuild listen pages or F1 scores by calling TTS. A missing page is not permission to synth.
- "Give me the list again" means reopen what exists. It does not mean rescore or regenerate.

A change is allowed only when the user explicitly asked for that specific edit and confirmed it, and you append `why` to `data/gold_gemini_ipa/changes.jsonl` before writing.

See `data/gold_gemini_ipa/README.md`.
